This directory contains the implementation of the Chrome OS Registration
extension. Note that the extension manifest is a part of the Chrome source
(src/chrome/browser/resources/chromeos/echo/manifest.json).

To run the extension on other Chrome platorm (non-Chrome OS) using fake
registration codes):

// Rename the manifest.json.
$ mv manifest.json.nochromeos manifest.json

// Load extension from the command line.
$ chrome --load-extension=/path/to/this/location

You  can also load the unpacked extension directly from within Chrome.

1. Navigate to chrome://extensions
2. Enable "Developer mode"
3. "Load unpacked extension..." -> Navigate to the folder containing this file.
